  m_text: "You\u2019re an independent courier working your way across the system.\n\nTake
    delivery jobs from strangers, sling yourself between stations, earn credits,
    and decide how much trouble you\u2019re willing to get into along the way.\n\n\n\n<size=85%>Flight
    School covers the basics of piloting your ship. This guide covers everything
    else.</size>"
