  m_text: "Orbit a station to access its <b>Delivery Menu</b>.\n\nFrom there, choose
    the type of job you\u2019re looking for and accept a package. Your destination
    will be marked once the delivery begins.\n\nDeliver the package successfully
    to earn <b>credits</b> and improve your standing as a courier.\n\n\n<size=85%>You
    don\u2019t need to stop moving for long \u2014 grab a job, launch, and keep flying.</size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 63c96e678ec7071458461f22e2ba55ce, type: 2}
