  m_text: "Certain jobs and actions may attract <b>police attention</b>.\n\nAs your
    Wanted Level rises, more police ships may join the pursuit. Their tractor beams
    can slow your ship down and make escaping increasingly difficult.\n\nBreak contact
    with the police and stay out of sight long enough to clear the chase.\n\n\n<size=85%>Higher
    risk can mean greater rewards \u2014 but you still need to make it to the destination.</size>"
