  m_text: "Not every delivery is the same.\n\n<b>SAFE</b>\nStraightforward courier
    work. Lower risk and generally predictable cargo.\n\n<b>RISKY</b>\nQuestionable
    clients, suspicious cargo, and jobs more likely to attract unwanted attention.\n\n<b>WEIRD</b>\nUnusual
    requests, strange cargo, and deliveries where you may not know exactly what you\u2019re
    getting yourself into.\n\n<size=85%>Pick whatever sounds interesting. There\u2019s
    no single \u201Ccorrect\u201D way to play.</size>"
