  m_text: "Some packages do more than sit in your cargo hold.\n\nCargo can affect
    the way your ship handles, change your speed or mass, attract attention, or create
    other complications during a delivery.\n\nCheck the job information before launching
    so you know what you\u2019re carrying.\n\n\n<size=85%>Sometimes the weirdest
    package is worth taking just to see what happens.</size>"
